  "description": "Free command-line tool built on DicomKit: C-ECHO, C-STORE, C-FIND (Patient / Study Root), C-MOVE, Modality Worklist, anonymization and file dumps. Install with \"dotnet tool install -g DicomKit.Cli\" and run \"dicomkit --help\". The underlying toolkit requires a license key: a free Developer key from https://dicomkit.plogic.dev/DeveloperKey is enough (pass --license-key or set DICOMKIT_LICENSE_KEY).",
